## 🚫 Guardrails & Best Practices (Avoid Over-Engineering!)
1. **Zero External Paid Services**: Everything must use native Web APIs (`crypto.subtle`, `RTCPeerConnection`), Node.js standard libraries (`crypto`), and Supabase.
2. **Never Break Test Suite**: Always run `npm test` after each change. Keep existing tests passing.
3. **Preserve Sub-Millisecond Speed**: Backend scoring in `pages/api/verify.ts` must remain $<20\text{ms}$.
4. **Graceful Fallbacks**: If WebRTC or Web Crypto is disabled in a strict environment, degrade gracefully without throwing fatal errors.
5. **Clean Code & Types**: Strictly typed TypeScript interfaces for all payloads.

